  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The dedicated evaluation framework for oncology foundation models \u2014 Apache-2.0, v0.4.5 April 2026, MIDL 2024 peer-reviewed. Provides standardised benchmarking across patch/slide/scan classification, segmentation, and VQA for both pathology and radiology FMs. 156 stars is modest but Kaiko is a credible pathology AI company and the tool fills a real gap as the evaluation counterpart to TRIDENT. Assess for teams building or comparing foundation models across oncology imaging tasks.",
